# A signal name exactly one character over the limit (80 for a 79-character
# field) has to be cut to 79 and the user told the maximum. It was kept whole
# without the notice: the check was strlen > 80, not > 79 (Development Issues
# #75). Reopening always shows 79 characters, so only the notice in the log
# tells the two apart; RegressionTests.cmake checks for it.
VERSION 13
DEMOINIT
ORIG 0.000 0.000 0.000
ROOMSIZE 40.000 x 20.000
SCALE HO
SIGNAL 1 0 HO 2 5.000000 5.000000 90.000000 2 "G1"
	END$SIGNAL
REDRAW
COMMAND Describe
MOUSE 2 5.000 5.000
MOUSE 4 5.000 5.000
PARAMETER Describe Signal 1 NNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNN
PARAMETER Describe Signal cancel
COMMAND Describe
MOUSE 2 5.000 5.000
MOUSE 4 5.000 5.000
PARAMCHECK Describe Signal 1 NNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNN
PARAMETER Describe Signal cancel
